trait-unclonable-name = Unclonable
trait-unclonable-desc = Your unique DNA composition is incompatible with cloning technology. You cannot be cloned.

trait-unlucky-name = Unlucky
trait-unlucky-desc = Vending machines have it out for you. Bump into one and it might just fall on top of you.

trait-lawbound-name = Law-Bound
trait-lawbound-desc = For whatever reason, NT doesn't trust you on their stations without imposing laws onto you. Also allows emagging and ion laws. Please reread Rule 12 and the IPC species entry in the Guidebook before choosing this trait.
